# The neofetch-style splash.
Output docs/images/once.gif
Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Set Width 900
Set Height 500

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show
Type "txoko --once --seed 3 --season autumn --sky night --size 46x18" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot docs/images/once.png
Sleep 1s
